# C API Reference

{info:title=Complete C-Level API Documentation}
This comprehensive reference documents all C functions, structures, and interfaces for developers working with the PostgreSQL Blockchain Extension at the C level, including extension development and core system integration.
{info}

{toc:printable=true|style=disc|maxLevel=3}

